very prominent aristocratic family in Athens. Coesyra was the mother of a Megacles from this family, a woman well known for her wasteful expenditures and pride. }}}{\field \fldedit {\*\fldinst {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 HYPERLINK \'5cl "note5"}}{\fldrslt {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 \line }{\*\bkmkend text5}}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  When I married her and we both went to bed, }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 60}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  I stunk of fresh wine, drying figs, sheep\uc1 \u8217 ?s wool}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u8212 ? }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 [50]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  an abundance of good things. As for her,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  she smelled of perfume, saffron, long kisses,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  greed, extravagance, lots and lots of sex.}{\*\bkmkstart text6}{\field \fldedit {\*\fldinst {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  HYPERLINK "" \'5cl "note6" }}{\fldrslt {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The Greek has \uc1 \u8220 ?of Colias and Genetyllis\uc1 \u8221 ? names associated with festivals celebrating women\uc1 \u8217 ?s sexual and procreative powers. }}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 \line }{\*\bkmkend text6}}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  Now, I\uc1 \u8217 ?m not saying she was a lazy bones.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  She used to weave, but used up too much wool.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  To make a point I\uc1 \u8217 ?d show this cloak to her}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  and say, \uc1 \u8220 ?Woman, your weaving\uc1 \u8217 ?s far too thick.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 Packing the wool tight in weaving uses up more wool and therefore costs more. Strepsiades holds up his cloak}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 .}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  which is by now full of holes. }}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \par }\pard \plain \s31 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx7440 \tql \tx7920 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af0 \loch \af0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \lang