uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  I place the blame for this on you intellectuals,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  on whose behalf I went to all that trouble.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  But still I won\uc1 \u8217 ?t ever willingly abandon}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  the discriminating ones among you all,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  not since that time when my play about two men}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  one was virtuous, the other one depraved}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  was really well received by certain people here, }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 710}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  whom it pleases me to mention now. As for me,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  I was still unmarried, not yet fully qualified}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 [530]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  to produce that child. But I exposed my offspring,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  and another woman carried it away.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  In your generosity you raised and trained it.}{\*\bkmkstart text38}{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 This passage is a reference to Aristophanes\uc1 \u8217 ? first play, }{\i1 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The Banqueters}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 , and to those who helped him get the work produced. The child mentioned is a metaphorical reference to that work or to his artistic talent generally. The other woman is a metaphorical reference to Callistratos, who produced }{\i1 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The Banqueters}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 . }}}{\field \fldedit {\*\fldinst {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 HYPERLINK \'5cl "note38"}}{\fldrslt {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 \line }{\*\bkmkend text38}}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  Since then I\uc1 \u8217 ?ve had sworn testimony from you}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  that you have faith in me. So now, like old Electra,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  this comedy has come, hoping she can find,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  somewhere in here, spectators as intelligent.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  If she sees her brother\uc1 \u8217 ?s hair, she\uc1 \u8217 ?ll recognize it.}{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 Electra was the sister of Orestes and spent a long time waiting to be reunited with him. That hope kept her going. When she saw her brother\uc1 \u8217 ?s lock of hair on their father\uc1 \u8217 ?s tomb, she was overjoyed that he had come back. The adjective \uc1 \u8220 ?old\uc1 \u8221 ? refers to the story, which was very well known to the audience. }}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 720}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  Consider how my play shows natural restraint.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  First, she doesn\uc1 \u8217 ?t have stitched leather dangling down,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  with a thick red knob, to make the children giggle.}{\*\bkmkstart text40}{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \qj \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 These lines may indicate that in}{\i1 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  Clouds}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  the male characters did not wear the traditional phalluses or that the phalluses they did wear were not of a particular kind. }}}{\field \fldedit {\*\fldinst {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 HYPERLINK \'5cl "note40"}}{\fldrslt {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 }{\fs24 \rtlch \l