\hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf13 \ul1 }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  we frowned and then complained aloud}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 our thunder pealed}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  among the lightning bursts, the moon moved off her course,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  the sun at once pulled his wick back inside himself,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  and said if Cleon was to be your general}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  then he\uc1 \u8217 ?d give you no light.}{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The phrase }{\i1 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 Paphlagonian tanner}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  is a reference to Cleon, who earned his money from tanneries. Paphlagonia is an area in Asia Minor. The word here implies that Cleon was not a true Athenian. The words also is close to the verb meaning }{\i1 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 to bluster}{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  (a reference to Cleon\uc1 \u8217 ?s loud and aggressive political style).}}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  Nonetheless, you chose him.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \