ch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  for starters, feeble shoulders, a pale skin,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  a narrow chest, huge tongue, a tiny bum,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  and a large skill in framing long decrees.}{\cs24 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \super1 \chftn {\footnote \pard \plain \s32 \qj \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa60 \sbauto0 \saauto0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx5472 \tql \tx6048 \itap0 \fs16 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \af0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\cs24 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \af6 \super1 \chftn }{\fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The Greek says \uc1 \u8220 ?and a long decree,\uc1 \u8221 ? which makes little sense in English. The point of the joke is to set the audience up to expect \uc1 \u8220 ?and a long prick\uc1 \u8221 ? (which was considered a characteristic of barbarians). }}}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105  }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \